        <article><![CDATA[<p>Open each applicable alias and click New in its Connections or Credentials related list.</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li><strong>Both API versions</strong> — Under <strong>Doppel_TI_API </strong>create an active HTTP(s) Connection with the URL <code><a href="https://api.doppel.com" rel="nofollow">https://api.doppel.com</a></code>. Leave Credential blank.</li><li><strong>API v2 </strong>— Under <strong>Doppel_V2_Client_Credentials</strong>, create an active Basic Auth Credential. Enter the Doppel Client ID as User name and the Client Secret as Password.</li><li><strong>API v1 </strong>— Create an active API Key Credential under each of <strong>Doppel_V1_API_Key</strong> and <strong>Doppel_V1_User_API_Key</strong>. Enter the corresponding key in API Key. Leave API Key Header and API Key Prefix blank.</li></ul>
<p>Mark this task complete, then continue to Configure Doppel.</p>]]></article>
